pi-CAW

Independent Pi adaptation of Codex Agents Workflow:
https://github.com/TohmaN233/codex-agents-workflow

The reusable workflow core, Workbench, templates and authoring contracts derive
from that project. Imported revisions and later upstream features are recorded
in docs/upstream.json. Pi adapters and subsequent changes are maintained in this
separate repository:
https://github.com/TohmaN233/pi-CAW

The original MIT license and copyright notice are retained in LICENSE.
Bundled third-party frontend license notices are retained in
web/workflows.LICENSE.txt and the compiled frontend's inline notices.

Pi SDK dependencies are supplied by the Pi host and are not vendored here.
